        story: 'This story demonstrates inserting notes. Use the Project menu (hamburger) above the ' + 'editor to insert footnotes, cross-references, and endnotes at the current cursor ' + 'position. Selecting text before inserting a footnote will use that text as the ' + 'footnote quote. You can also insert by typing "\\\\f", "\\\\x", or "\\\\fe".'
